nodecode-kiwi is a rewrite of harrylabsj's harrylabsj/hermes-plugin-kiwi:

  https://github.com/harrylabsj/hermes-plugin-kiwi
  commit e6edb130d04d4fdfdb7144305bdb2f3829bf8fae

